        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DoralLock 6900, Portland Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Portland Knob is a perfect enhancement for traditional or contemporary homes. The rounded design is proportioned to comfortably fit the palm of the hand. DoralLock's Portland Knob with matching rose is a great choice. It is available in dummy, passage, privacy, or keyed entry functions. The Keyed Entry function features a 5-pin cylinder and meets ANSI A 156.2 grade 2 cylindrical lock standards. All functions are available in 7 finishes. Designed to be easy to install, especially on pre-drilled doors with 2-1/8 inch holes, this knobset will fit 1-3/8 inch and 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses with an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of DoralLock Portland Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install, this knob fits standard pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Keyed entry function is ANSI rated grade 2 security.</li>\r\n<li>Keyed entry function is 5 pin Kwikset compatible keyway.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Portland Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DOR-6900-specifications.pdf?v=1704262175\" target=\"new\"><b>DoralLock 6900 Portland Knob Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. Complete Set - 1 knob and 1 rose.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.  Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch and strike plate</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a finger turn located in the middle of the knob. In an emergency, it can unlock from the exterior using a coin or a screwdriver. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (keyed Lock):</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a finger turn on the knob from the interior. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Portland Door Knobset, DoralLock 6900",
                "description": "DoralLock 6900, Portland Knob - A perfect enhancement for traditional or contemporary homes. The rounded design is proportioned to comfortably fit the palm of the hand. DoralLock's Portland Knob with matching rose is a great choice. It is available in dummy, passage, privacy, or keyed entry functions. The Keyed Entry function features a 5-pin cylinder and meets ANSI A 156.2 grade 2 cylindrical lock standards. All functions are made out of solid brass and are available in 7 finishes. Designed to be easy to install, especially on pre-drilled doors with 2-1/8 inch holes, this knobset will fit 1-3/8 inch and 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses with an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
